      "caveat": "仅该音丛起源，不把所有t变送气",
      "phase": "dialect",
      "productivity": "root-or-context-controlled"
    },
    {
      "id": "N15",
      "scope": "北部",
      "type": "lexicalized",
      "description": "高频中性时间词 utro 末尾 -o 弱化脱落",
      "example": "utro→utr",
      "caveat": "词形类推后需重新推导变格",
      "phase": "dialect",
      "productivity": "restricted"
    },
    {
